<title>JAPAN: Sony Corp shares fall on profit-taking in morning.</title>
<headline>Sony Corp shares fall on profit-taking in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp fell below 9,000 yen in Monday morning, trade hit by profit-taking inspired by signs of strength in the yen as well as weakness in high-technology shares on Wall Street on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0036 GMT, the shares were down 120 yen at 8,930.</p>
